# .bobrules for DevPulse

See .bob/rules/devpulse.md for the full rules. In short:
- sample_app/ stays vulnerable; fixes are diffs under audit/fixes/
- never read audit/ground_truth.json unless asked to score
- findings go to audit/findings.json (schema: audit/findings.schema.json)
- per-file work runs in parallel subagents
- screenshot the task session summary into bob_sessions/ after every task
